t tracking\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"id\": \"I-17\",\n   \"text\": \"Build administrative tools for product, user, category, and price list management\"\n  }\n ],\n \"touchesUi\": true\n}\n</artifact>\n\n<artifact id=\"answers\" kind=\"answers\" sha=\"\">\n[\n {\n  \"id\": \"Q-1\",\n  \"question\": \"Is the Customer Account Manager role in the first release? And can a Buyer see all of their company's orders (section 3.1) or only the orders they placed (section 3.2 implies only managers see other users' orders)?\",\n  \"answer\": \"No Account Manager role; every Buyer sees all of their company's orders and invoices\",\n  \"by\": \"Hamza (via web)\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"Q-2\",\n  \"question\": \"Which invoices can a customer see? Invoices are only created when an order becomes Delivered (section 29), so should the invoice list simply show every invoice that exists for the customer's company?\",\n  \"answer\": \"Customers see every invoice that exists for their company; invoices only exist once the order is Delivered\",\n  \"by\": \"Hamza (via web)\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"Q-3\",\n  \"question\": \"After confirmation, which status changes can staff make? In particular, can staff cancel a Confirmed or later order for a customer who phones in?\",\n  \"answer\": \"Staff move orders forward one step at a time and can cancel any order that is not yet Delivered\",\n  \"by\": \"Hamza (via web)\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"Q-4\",\n  \"question\": \"What is recorded in the audit history for customer accounts and catalogue changes, and who can view it?\",\n  \"answer\": \"Who, when, and which fields changed (old and new values); admins only\",\n  \"by\": \"Hamza (via web)\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"Q-5\",\n  \"question\": \"Can customers create or edit their own delivery addresses, or are addresses maintained only by staff or admins?\",\n  \"answer\": \"Customers can only select from addresses that staff or admins maintain\",\n  \"by\": \"Hamza (via web)\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"Q-6\",\n  \"question\": \"Customer Buyers can see all of their company's orders. Should saved basket templates also be shared with every Buyer in the company, or stay private to the Buyer who made them?\",\n  \"answer\": \"Templates are private to the Buyer who created them\",\n  \"by\": \"Hamza (via web)\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"Q-7\",\n  \"question\": \"There is no management role. Who can see the sales and product reports, and which reports are in the first release?\",\n  \"answer\": \"Office staff and admins; sales by period, sales by customer, and top products\",\n  \"by\": \"Hamza (via web)\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"Q-8\",\n  \"question\": \"How is stock checked when an order is placed or confirmed? Stock only changes with the nightly ERP import, and the portal never decrements it.\",\n  \"answer\": \"Compare the ordered quantity with the last imported quantity, without subtracting orders placed since the import\",\n  \"by\": \"Hamza (via web)\"\n }\n]\n</artifact>\n\n<artifact id=\"assumptions\" kind=\"assumptions\" sha=\"\">\n[\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q2\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-13\",\n   \"I-15\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-1\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"Saved basket templates (section 16) are not in the intent list. Are they in scope for this build? → assumed: Out of scope for this build; only repeat order is built\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q5\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-3\",\n   \"I-11\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-2\",\n  \"risk\": \"high\",\n  \"text\": \"What happens when a product has no price in the customer's assigned price list? → assumed: The product is shown with 'Price unavailable' and cannot be added to the basket\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q6\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-11\",\n   \"I-16\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-3\",\n  \"risk\": \"high\",\n  \"text\": \"Are prices stored and shown with or without tax, and do invoices need tax lines? → assumed: All prices exclude tax, and invoices show net amounts only\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": 