taff confirm it\"\n    }\n   ],\n   \"ears\": \"When Office Staff confirm a Received order, the portal shall check every line against the last imported stock quantity and the customer company's active status and, if both pass, set the order to Confirmed and record the confirming user and time; otherwise reject the confirmation naming the reason.\",\n   \"id\": \"REQ-30\",\n   \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n   \"sources\": [\n    \"I-14\",\n    \"I-4\",\n    \"Q-8\"\n   ],\n   \"stability\": 1\n  },\n  {\n   \"acceptance\": [\n    {\n     \"given\": \"An order by Buyer X where staff changed P from 10 to 8 before confirming\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-31.1\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"One email goes to Buyer X with the order number, lines, total, delivery date and address, and 'P: 10 → 8'\",\n     \"when\": \"Staff confirm it\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"A staff-created order for company A\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-31.2\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"The confirmation email goes to company A's contact email\",\n     \"when\": \"Staff confirm it\"\n    }\n   ],\n   \"ears\": \"When an order becomes Confirmed, the portal shall email the order recipient a confirmation containing the order number, lines, quantities, unit prices, total, delivery address, delivery date, and every quantity change or line removal made by staff.\",\n   \"id\": \"REQ-31\",\n   \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n   \"sources\": [\n    \"I-14\",\n    \"I-5\",\n    \"ASM-15\",\n    \"ASM-25\",\n    \"ASM-39\"\n   ],\n   \"stability\": 1\n  },\n  {\n   \"acceptance\": [\n    {\n     \"given\": \"Orders in Received and in Out for delivery\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-32.1\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"Both become Cancelled with reason, user and time in the timeline; one email per order with the order number and reason is sent\",\n     \"when\": \"Staff cancel each with reason 'Customer phoned'\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"A Received order\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-32.2\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"Response is 400 and status stays Received\",\n     \"when\": \"Staff reject it without a reason\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"A Delivered order\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-32.3\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"Response is 409 and status stays Delivered\",\n     \"when\": \"Staff cancel it with a reason\"\n    }\n   ],\n   \"ears\": \"When Office Staff reject or cancel an order that is not Delivered, the portal shall require a reason, set the order to Cancelled, record the reason, acting user and timestamp, and email the order recipient the cancellation with the reason.\",\n   \"id\": \"REQ-32\",\n   \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n   \"sources\": [\n    \"I-14\",\n    \"Q-3\",\n    \"ASM-14\",\n    \"ASM-15\",\n    \"ASM-26\",\n    \"ASM-38\",\n    \"ASM-40\"\n   ],\n   \"stability\": 1\n  },\n  {\n   \"acceptance\": [\n    {\n     \"given\": \"A Received order with 5 x P and address A1\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-33.1\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"The order shows 3 x P with recalculated total and A2; amendment history records S, time, P 5→3 and A1→A2; the Buyer's order detail shows the amendments\",\n     \"when\": \"Staff user S changes P to 3 and the address to A2\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"A Confirmed order\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-33.2\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"Response is 409 and the order is unchanged\",\n     \"when\": \"Staff change a line quantity\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"A Received order\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-33.3\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"Each change is rejected and the order is unchanged\",\n     \"when\": \"Staff set the delivery date to a Saturday, set another company's address, or remove the last remaining line\"\n    }\n   ],\n   \"ears\": \"While an order is in Received status, the portal shall let Office Staff change line quantities, remove lines (keeping at least one line), and change the delivery date, the delivery address to another of the 