rders) with all listed columns\",\n     \"when\": \"Staff export the delivery list for 5 March\"\n    }\n   ],\n   \"ears\": \"When Office Staff export the delivery list for a date, the portal shall return a CSV with one row per non-cancelled order due that date (any status other than Cancelled, including Received) containing order number, customer, delivery address, contact name, contact phone, delivery date, line summary, note and status.\",\n   \"id\": \"REQ-38\",\n   \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n   \"sources\": [\n    \"I-6\"\n   ],\n   \"stability\": 0.6666666666666666\n  },\n  {\n   \"acceptance\": [\n    {\n     \"given\": \"For 12 May: one Confirmed, one Out for delivery, one Received and one Cancelled order; one Confirmed order for 13 May\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-39.1\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"The CSV has a header and exactly 2 rows (the Confirmed and Out for delivery orders) with all listed columns\",\n     \"when\": \"Staff export the delivery list for 12 May\"\n    }\n   ],\n   \"ears\": \"When Office Staff export the delivery list for a date (today by default), the portal shall return a CSV with one row per order due that date in status Confirmed, Picking, Out for delivery or Delivered, containing order number, customer, delivery address, contact name, contact phone, delivery date, line summary, note and status.\",\n   \"id\": \"REQ-39\",\n   \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n   \"sources\": [\n    \"I-6\",\n    \"ASM-43\"\n   ],\n   \"stability\": 0.3333333333333333\n  },\n  {\n   \"acceptance\": [\n    {\n     \"given\": \"2 Received, 1 Confirmed, 1 Picking, 1 Out for delivery order, 1 order due today, 3 unpaid invoices of which 1 overdue, latest import Failed\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-40.1\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"The response shows those counts and the Failed import with its timestamp\",\n     \"when\": \"Staff request the dashboard\"\n    }\n   ],\n   \"ears\": \"When Office Staff or Administrators open the dashboard, the portal shall show the counts of Received, Confirmed, Picking and Out for delivery orders, orders due for delivery today, Unpaid and Overdue invoices, and the result and time of the latest stock import.\",\n   \"id\": \"REQ-40\",\n   \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n   \"sources\": [\n    \"I-6\",\n    \"I-12\",\n    \"I-16\"\n   ],\n   \"stability\": 1\n  },\n  {\n   \"acceptance\": [\n    {\n     \"given\": \"Company A with orders dated 1, 2 and 3 March from two Buyers and staff, the 2 March one Cancelled\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-41.1\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"All 3 are returned in order 3, 2, 1 March with all listed fields\",\n     \"when\": \"A Buyer of A lists orders\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"The same orders\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-41.2\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"Each filter returns only the matching order\",\n     \"when\": \"The Buyer filters by status Cancelled, and then by order date 3 March\"\n    }\n   ],\n   \"ears\": \"When a Customer Buyer lists orders, the portal shall return every order of the Buyer's company, newest first, with order number, order date, delivery date, delivery address, total and status, filterable by status and order date range.\",\n   \"id\": \"REQ-41\",\n   \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n   \"sources\": [\n    \"I-5\",\n    \"I-15\",\n    \"Q-1\"\n   ],\n   \"stability\": 1\n  },\n  {\n   \"acceptance\": [\n    {\n     \"given\": \"A Confirmed order with 2 lines, a note and a staff quantity amendment 5→3\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-42.1\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"All listed fields are present, the timeline shows Received and Confirmed with timestamps, and the amendment shows 5 → 3\",\n     \"when\": \"A Buyer of the company opens it\"\n    }\n   ],\n   \"ears\": \"When a Customer Buyer opens an order of their company, the portal shall return its number, order date, customer, delivery address, requested delivery date, current status, status timeline, lines with quantity, unit price and line total, order total, note and any staff amendments.\",\n   \"id\": \"REQ-42\",\n   \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n   \"sources\": [\n    \"I-5\",\n    \"I-15\"\n   ],\n   \"stability\": 1\n  },\n  {\n   \"acceptance\": [\n    {\n     \"given\": \"A Received order of company A\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-43.1\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"Status becomes Cancelled and the timeline names the Buyer and time\",\n     \"when\": \"A Buyer of A cancels it\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"A Confirmed order of company A\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-43.2\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"Response is 409 with a message to contact the distributor office and status stays Confirmed\",\n     \"when\": \"A Buyer of A cancels it\"\n    }\n   ],\n   \"ears\": \"While an order is in Received status, the portal shall let a Customer Buyer of that company cancel it, recording the Buyer and time in the timeline, and shall reject Buyer cancellation of any other status with a message to contact the distributor office.\",\n   \"id\": \"REQ-43\",\n   \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n   \"sources\": [\n    \"I-15\"\n   ],\n   \"stability\": 1\n  },\n  {\n   \"acceptance\": [\n    {\n     \"given\": \"Past order with 2 x P (then 8.00, now 8.50), 1 x R (retired), 1 x Q (Out of stock)\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-44.1\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"The basket gains 2 x P at 8.50; R and Q are flagged and not added; the company's order count is unchanged\",\n     \"when\": \"The Buyer repeats the order\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"A basket already holding 1 x P\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-44.2\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"The basket holds 3 x P\",\n     \"when\": \"The Buyer repeats the same order\"\n    }\n   ],\n   \"ears\": \"When a Customer Buyer repeats a previous order of their company, the portal shall add each line whose product is active, priced and not Out of stock to the Buyer's basket at the current price-list price and original quantity, adding to the quantity of any existing basket line for that product, and return the other lines flagged as unavailable, without creating an order.\",\n   \"id\": \"REQ-44\",\n   \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n   \"sources\": [\n    \"I-15\",\n    \"I-13\",\n    \"ASM-45\"\n   ],\n   \"stability\": 1\n  },\n  {\n   \"acceptance\": [\n    {\n     \"given\": \"Buyer B1 saves a basket as 'Weekly Workshop Order'\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-45.1\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"B1 sees the template; B2 sees none and requesting it by ID returns 404\",\n     \"when\": \"B1 and B2 (same company) list templates\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"B1's template with 2 x P (now 8.50) and 1 x R (retired)\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-45.2\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"The basket gains 2 x P at 8.50, R is flagged; the template no longer appears in B1's list\",\n     \"when\": \"B1 adds the template to the basket, then deletes the template\"\n    }\n   ],\n   \"ears\": \"When a Customer Buyer saves the basket as a named template, the portal shall store the template privately for that Buyer and, when the template is added to the basket, use current price-list prices and flag unavailable products.\",\n   \"id\": \"REQ-45\",\n   \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n   \"sources\": [\n    \"I-13\",\n    \"Q-6\"\n   ],\n   \"stability\": 0.3333333333333333\n  },\n  {\n   \"acceptance\": [\n    {\n     \"given\": \"An Out for delivery order with 3 x P at 8.50 (net 25.50), tax rate 20%, last invoice INV-000040\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-46.1\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"Exactly one invoice INV-000041 exists with status Unpaid, net 25.50, tax 5.10, total 30.60 and the order's lines and number\",\n     \"when\": \"Staff set it to Delivered\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"An order in Picking\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-46.2\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"No invoice exists for that order\",\n     \"when\": \"Invoices for its company are listed\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"Invoice INV-000041\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-46.3\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"INV-000041 still shows tax 5.10 and total 30.60\",\n     \"when\": \"An admin changes the tax rate to 15%\"\n    }\n   ],\n   \"ears\": \"When an order's status becomes Delivered, the portal shall create one Unpaid invoice with the next sequential number of the form INV-000123, invoice date, customer, billing address, order number, lines with quantity and order-time unit price, net total, tax at the configured rate, and gross total.\",\n   \"id\": \"REQ-46\",\n   \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n   \"sources\": [\n    \"I-16\",\n    \"I-5\",\n    \"ASM-22\",\n    \"ASM-31\",\n    \"ASM-3\",\n    \"ASM-46\"\n   ],\n   \"stability\": 1\n  },\n  {\n   \"acceptance\": [\n    {\n     \"given\": \"Overdue days 30 and an unpaid invoice dated 1 March\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-47.1\",\n     \"level\": \"unit\",\n     \"then\": \"Results are Unpaid and Overdue\",\n     \"when\": \"The status is calculated for 31 March and 1 April\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"An invoice dated 1 January with a recorded payment\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-47.2\",\n     \"level\": \"unit\",\n     \"then\": \"Result is Paid\",\n     \"when\": \"The status is calculated for 1 April\"\n    }\n   ],\n   \"ears\": \"The portal shall report an invoice as Paid when a payment is recorded, as Overdue when unpaid and more than the overdue-days setting has passed since its invoice date, and otherwise as Unpaid.\",\n   \"id\": \"REQ-47\",\n   \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n   \"sources\": [\n    \"I-16\",\n    \"I-5\",\n    \"ASM-10\",\n    \"ASM-32\"\n   ],\n   \"stability\": 1\n  },\n  {\n   \"acceptance\": [\n    {\n     \"given\": \"Company A has 2 invoices from orders by different Buyers; company C has 1\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-48.1\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"The Buyer sees A's 2 invoices; staff see all 3, each with the listed fields\",\n     \"when\": \"A Buyer of A lists invoices; staff list invoices\"\n    }\n   ],\n   \"ears\": \"When a user lists invoices,